sequenceDiagram
  actor User as Meal Planner
  participant UI as MealPlanningGUI or MealPlanningCLI
  participant PS as PantryService or ProfileService
  participant MPO as MealPlanImpactObserver
  participant GLO as GroceryListImpactObserver
  participant MS as MealPlanService
  participant GS as GroceryService
  participant C as AgentController
  participant A as MealPlanningAgent
  participant L as LLMClient
  participant LPA as ProviderLLMAdapter
  participant API as ExternalLLMProviderAPI
  participant CV as ConstraintValidator
  participant F as MealPlanningFacade
  User->>UI: report relevant change
  UI->>F: updatePantry(item)
  F->>PS: updateItem(profileId, item)
  PS-->>MPO: onPlanRelevantChange(event)
  PS-->>GLO: onPlanRelevantChange(event)
  GLO->>GS: markAffectedListStale(event)
  MPO->>MS: assessImpact(activePlan, event)
  MS-->>MPO: PlanImpact for affected meals and grocery items
  MPO->>C: adaptPlan(plan, event)
  C->>A: proposeAdaptation(context, impact)
  A->>L: generateStructured(adaptationPrompt, PlanChange schema)
  L->>LPA: generateStructured(prompt, schema)
  LPA->>API: createStructuredResponse(request)
  API-->>LPA: provider response
  LPA-->>L: StructuredResponse
  L-->>A: structured adaptation proposal
  A-->>C: PlanChange alternatives
  C->>CV: validatePlan(proposal, context)
  alt adaptation is viable
    CV-->>C: valid
    C-->>F: adaptation preview
    F-->>UI: show affected items and proposal
    User->>UI: confirm
    UI->>F: executeChange(planId, change)
    F->>MS: executeChange(plan, command)
    MS-->>F: updated plan/list
    F-->>UI: display adapted plan
  else adaptation is not viable
    CV-->>C: conflicts
    C-->>F: unresolved impact and options
    F-->>UI: preserve current plan; show conflicts
  end
